{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかも生駒ちゃんも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日が十代ラストセーラー服でした。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/12/16/7560628/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テーマは15歳。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見納めだよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/12/16/7560628/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残り少ない十代楽しみます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう考えたら生駒ちゃん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次のMステのステージがラスト十代生放送ですね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紅白歌合戦は20歳最初のお仕事。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに濃い人生を送れて幸せです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい⭐︎"}],"source":"archive"}